.NET Framework 4.5.1 | 378675  
.NET Framework 4.5.2 | 379893  
.NET Framework 4.6 | 393295  
.NET Framework 4.6.1 | 394254  
.NET Framework 4.6.2 | 394802  
.NET Framework 4.7 | 460798  
.NET Framework 4.7.1 | 461308  
