### EntityClient
The code in this example uses an [EntityCommand](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.data.entityclient.entitycommand) to execute an Entity SQL query. This query returns a list of records that represent instances of the Categories entity type. An [EntityDataReader](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.data.entityclient.entitydatareader) is used to access data records in the result set. For more information, see [EntityClient Provider for the Entity Framework](https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/framework/data/adonet/ef/entityclient-provider-for-the-entity-framework).
